                        "review": "I didn't know I wanted a VR sledding game until I saw this, its a pretty simple game, but also pretty entertaining.\n\nA couple of things that I think could make this game better though is longer slopes to go down and the implementation of tricks, like being able to do a 180 in the air if the controllers are moved in a certain way or if a button is pressed or something like that. I think being able to do a frontflip or backflip on the sled in the air would be really cool.",
